examples.question_text:
The graph shows a car's journey. Calculate its acceleration during each of the five stages, and state when it is stationary.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=2.5mm,y=2mm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\definecolor{graphblue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\definecolor{gridgrey}{HTML}{CCCCCC}
\draw[gridgrey,very thin,xstep=5mm,ystep=8mm] (0,0) grid (24,16);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(25,0);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(0,18);
\foreach \t in {0,4,10,14,18,24} {\draw[black] (\t,0)--(\t,-0.4);\node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (\t,-0.4) {$\t$};}
\foreach \v in {4,8,12,16} {\draw[black] (0,\v)--(-0.4,\v);\node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (-0.4,\v) {$\v$};}
\node[rotate=90] at (-4.5,8) {Speed (m/s)};
\node at (12,-4.5) {Time (s)};
\draw[graphblue,thick] (0,0)--(4,16)--(10,16)--(14,0)--(18,0)--(24,12);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The graph shows part of a boat's journey. Find:
(a) its acceleration from $2$ to $8$ s;
(b) the magnitude of its deceleration from $8$ to $12$ s.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=5mm,y=3mm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\definecolor{graphblue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\definecolor{gridgrey}{HTML}{CCCCCC}
\draw[gridgrey,very thin,xstep=10mm,ystep=6mm] (0,0) grid (12,12);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(13,0);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(0,13);
\foreach \t in {0,2,4,6,8,10,12} {\draw[black] (\t,0)--(\t,-0.25);\node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (\t,-0.25) {$\t$};}
\foreach \v in {2,4,6,8,10,12} {\draw[black] (0,\v)--(-0.15,\v);\node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (-0.15,\v) {$\v$};}
\node[rotate=90] at (-2.2,6) {Speed (m/s)};
\node at (6,-3) {Time (s)};
\draw[graphblue,thick] (2,3)--(8,12)--(12,4);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

examples.solution_text:
(a) Subtract both the starting speed and the starting time.

$\begin{aligned}\text{Acceleration}&=\frac{12-3}{8-2}\\&=\frac{9}{6}\\&=1.5\text{ m/s}^2\end{aligned}$

(b) The speed decreases by $8$ m/s over $4$ s.

$\begin{aligned}\text{Acceleration}&=\frac{4-12}{12-8}\\&=-2\text{ m/s}^2\end{aligned}$
The deceleration magnitude is $2$ m/s².

The dashed steps show the speed changes and time intervals.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=5mm,y=3mm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\definecolor{graphblue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\definecolor{graphred}{HTML}{EF6068}
\definecolor{gridgrey}{HTML}{CCCCCC}
\draw[gridgrey,very thin,xstep=10mm,ystep=6mm] (0,0) grid (12,12);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(13,0);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(0,13);
\foreach \t in {0,2,4,6,8,10,12} {\draw[black] (\t,0)--(\t,-0.25);\node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (\t,-0.25) {$\t$};}
\foreach \v in {2,4,6,8,10,12} {\draw[black] (0,\v)--(-0.15,\v);\node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (-0.15,\v) {$\v$};}
\node[rotate=90] at (-2.2,6) {Speed (m/s)};
\node at (6,-3) {Time (s)};
\draw[graphred,dashed] (2,3)--(8,3)--(8,12);
\draw[graphred,dashed] (8,12)--(12,12)--(12,4);
\node[below,fill=white,inner sep=1pt] at (5,3) {$6$ s};
\node[left,fill=white,inner sep=1pt] at (8,7.5) {$9$ m/s};
\node[above] at (10,12) {$4$ s};
\node[right] at (12,8) {$8$ m/s};
\draw[graphblue,thick] (2,3)--(8,12)--(12,4);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

examples.question_text:
Two vehicles accelerate from rest and then brake to a stop. Vehicle A is the blue solid line; vehicle B is the red dashed line. Calculate each vehicle's initial acceleration and final deceleration magnitude. Which vehicle accelerates faster, and which decelerates faster?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=4mm,y=1.5mm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\definecolor{graphblue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\definecolor{graphred}{HTML}{EF6068}
\definecolor{gridgrey}{HTML}{CCCCCC}
\draw[gridgrey,very thin,xstep=8mm,ystep=6mm] (0,0) grid (16,24);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(17,0);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(0,26);
\foreach \t in {0,2,4,6,8,10,12,14,16} {\draw[black] (\t,0)--(\t,-0.5);\node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (\t,-0.5) {$\t$};}
\foreach \v in {4,8,12,16,20,24} {\draw[black] (0,\v)--(-0.2,\v);\node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (-0.2,\v) {$\v$};}
\node[rotate=90] at (-2.8,12) {Speed (m/s)};
\node at (8,-6) {Time (s)};
\draw[graphblue,thick] (0,0)--(4,24)--(12,24)--(16,0);
\draw[graphred,thick,dashed] (0,0)--(6,12)--(12,12)--(14,0);
\node[above,text=graphblue] at (8,24) {A};
\node[above,text=graphred] at (8,12) {B};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
